  "bodyHash": "21e67197b9088dbf",
  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nmZFw0G.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><iframe style=\"width:415px;display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7bSSrTi7vTw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"415\" height=\"415\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>總覽</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>Town Citizen 是一款 Minecraft Forge 模組，旨在將村莊升級為城市與城鎮。</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UQL8R03.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>城鎮&nbsp;更新</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>新增第二種村民類型。</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>資訊</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>提供兩種城鎮可供選擇：城市與城鎮，</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>功能</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>原版村莊已被替換。可使用 /locate 指令尋找村莊。</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/InvTtq0.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>致謝</span></p>\n<p><span>此模組原始資料包由 Kogtyv 編寫，經 Taknax 轉換為模組。</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252fvillagerminitowns%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VZVF3ZT.png\"></a></span></p>\n<div style=\"display:none\"><span>&nbsp;</span></div>",
